@*
    The build stamp, vYYMMDD, bottom-right on every page, and the site's contentinfo landmark.

    Po web standard (2026-11-18): the stamp is the estate's .po-version (po-tokens.css). The
    date is the UTC date of the HEAD commit, computed once in Directory.Build.props
    (PoBuildStamp) and compiled into BuildInfo.BuildVersion, so the server's /api/diag reports the
    same value. On a phone it sits above the BottomNav (--po-stamp-lift, BottomNav.razor.css).
*@
<footer class="app-build-footer" aria-label="Site information">
    <span class="gl-sr-only">PoMiniGames, build @BuildInfo.BuildVersion</span>
    <span class="po-version" data-testid="build-version" aria-hidden="true">v@(BuildInfo.BuildVersion)</span>
</footer>
